\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For every finite-dimensional symmetric algebra A over a field, must each finite-dimensional module M with $Ext_A^i(M,M)=0$ for every integer $i>0$ be projective?

\subsection{Short English statement}
For every finite-dimensional symmetric algebra A over a field, must each finite-dimensional module M with $Ext_A^i(M,M)=0$ for every integer $i>0$ be projective?

\subsection{Sources}
